{"id":776929,"title":"02｜图像类AI工程化探索：ComfyUI的介绍与安装","content":"本节课介绍了Stable Diffusion及其两种用户界面：WebUI和ComfyUI。Stable Diffusion是Stability AI开发的开源图像生成模型，使用扩散模型技术将文本描述转化为高质量图片。WebUI基于Gradio库，直观易用；ComfyUI采用节点式设计，适合深入学习和复杂工作流程。建议同时学习两者，但课程重点讲解ComfyUI。ComfyUI的优势在于灵活性高、支持自定义工作流及自动化任务，且对硬件要求较低。安装ComfyUI需准备英伟达显卡、Python 3.10以上、CUDA、FFmpeg等工具。安装步骤包括配置环境、下载项目代码、安装依赖并运行。推荐安装ComfyUI Manager插件以管理资源和保存工作流。尽管ComfyUI初看复杂，但它提供了更多探索和创新的空间。课程鼓励大家安装并运行ComfyUI，下节课将讨论AI在音视频中的声音处理工具。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":403639,"user_name":"Geek_c65f0e","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":4438982,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"BBB28746E2132A","user_header":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaELqzPHNXUxBQ6n3EdXVIDK7AgraufN0yRBTliaUvlwibW6uOYdeia1kWpI35bt1f6UuP6Qia6gJRQEuInkLwRYFcvtaFzfkzQvicfhpiajVnkQqf97g/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1764228905,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100768301,"comment_content":"要是有人能帮我安装就好了","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":394633,"user_name":"Wynnja Woo","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1245466,"ip_address":"美国","ucode":"7772E909F83D35","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/13/01/1a/ab103c8b.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1727364480,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100768301,"comment_content":"翻译插件不起作用","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":390896,"user_name":"18610296143","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1067994,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"1D4C68E468C871","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/4b/da/c93eaab5.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1716633993,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100768301,"comment_content":"有几个问题：\n1、展示代码的时候，不知道是不是视频压缩的很厉害，画面很模糊，感觉要看清ide上面的字很费劲\n2、另外想问一下老师，mac环境应该怎样安装呢？","like_count":0}]}